  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Новый пропуск: setup({ rotate: true })",
      "text": "`rotate` выпускает консьержу новый ключ и меняет пароль его роли. Дом и данные не трогаются (`created: false`), а пропуск — новый. Его кладут в настройки приложения вместо прежнего.",
      "code": "const r = await setup(ADMIN_DSN, name, { rotate: true, quiet: true });\nnewPass = r.pass;\nreturn { created: r.created, 'пропуск новый': r.pass !== pass };",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ADMIN_DSN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name, { rotate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quiet: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">newPass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.pass;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { created: r.created, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'пропуск новый'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: r.pass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pass };</span></span></code></pre>",
