    {
      "title": "Новый консьерж: connect(новый пропуск)",
      "text": "Процесс с новым пропуском — полноценный консьерж: квартиры на месте, а токен Анны (`me.token`, например из cookie) открывает её корень через `resume()`.",
      "code": "fresh = await connect(newPass);\nconst anna = await fresh.resume(me.token!);\nreturn { 'квартиры': (await fresh.tenants()).map((t) => t.name), 'resume(токен Анны)': anna.tenantName };",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fresh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newPass);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> anna</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fresh.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(me.token</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'квартиры'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fresh.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tenants</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-da